      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "mutations → tRPC → invalidate queries\nmessage.send · message.stop · message.retry · version.restore · sandbox.wake · github.start / retry\ncode.write · code.remove · code.saveVersion · code.discard (locked while a prompt is pending)\n\nCode mode: version.files returns the unsaved working copy · autosave 1 s · ZIP via client-zip\nTerminal: fetch POST /api/terminal (streamed text), then invalidate version.files",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "muts",
      "originalText": "mutations → tRPC → invalidate queries\nmessage.send · message.stop · message.retry · version.restore · sandbox.wake · github.start / retry\ncode.write · code.remove · code.saveVersion · code.discard (locked while a prompt is pending)\n\nCode mode: version.files returns the unsaved working copy · autosave 1 s · ZIP via client-zip\nTerminal: fetch POST /api/terminal (streamed text), then invalidate version.files",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
